  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "It was a chilly October afternoon when the aliens attacked.\n\nWith a planet-encompassing EMP they destroyed everything digital. TVs, computers, data centers were all gone before you could think.\n\nAnyone close to a mobile phone was blown to bits.\n\nI never liked any of that shit. Never owned a goddamn phone or laptop. Analog tech is my jam.\n\nThe aliens seem to hate music. Good thing I've got a boombox and enough batteries to kick some alien ass.\n\nThe only problem is, I'm running out of new music to listen to. Maybe there are some good old casettes still lying around. Might as well take out some aliens on the way.\n\nIn my breakdance days I had a nickname. \n\nThey called me..."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 601b818b39b25d54f9ed1379d03bb9d8, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -8420376488311218990, guid: 601b818b39b25d54f9ed1379d03bb9d8, type: 2}
